          <section class="section caldos-section-1">
            <div class="caldo-feature">
              <div class="caldo-name">TLALPEÑO</div>
              <div class="caldo-sub">TLALPEÑO</div>
              <p class="caldo-text">
                Arroz servido en consomé de gallina, con pechuga deshebrada, queso asadero en cubos, tiras
                fritas en manteca, un toque de chipotle y aguacate fresco.
              </p>
              <p class="caldo-text">
                Rice served in hen broth, with shredded hen breast, asadero cheese cubes, fried strips of
                tortilla, a touch of chipotle, and fresh avocado.
              </p>
              <div class="caldo-sizes">
                <div class="caldo-size">CHICO/SMALL:</div>
                <div class="caldo-price">$ 104.00</div>
                <div class="caldo-size">GRANDE/LARGE:</div>
                <div class="caldo-price">$ 84.00</div>
